  _icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 994d5210f41e5d645a07375e18a2de86, type: 3}
  _description: Tastes like nothing. Faintly of almonds, if you think about it too
    hard.
  _longDescription: 'Bottled somewhere, by someone, for reasons the label doesn''t
    explain. It shouldn''t still be drinkable after all this time, and yet it always
    is -- cool, clear, and exactly as thirst-quenching as the day it was sealed.


    Finding
    one feels less like luck and more like being allowed to.'
